stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PatchToolCallsMiddleware_before_agent
    
    state "PatchToolCallsMiddleware.before_agent" as PatchToolCallsMiddleware_before_agent
    state "LocalContextMiddleware.before_agent" as LocalContextMiddleware_before_agent
    state "model" as model
    state "HumanInTheLoopMiddleware.after_model" as HumanInTheLoopMiddleware_after_model
    state "TodoListMiddleware.after_model" as TodoListMiddleware_after_model
    state "tools" as tools
    
    note right of LocalContextMiddleware_before_agent
        before_agent: Detects environment (Git status, files, tree, runtimes, Makefile)
        wrap_model_call: Injects local context markdown into the LLM system prompt
    end note
    
    note left of HumanInTheLoopMiddleware_after_model
        after_model: Pauses execution to request human-in-the-loop approval
        for tool calls (edit_file, write_file, execute) based on mode config
    end note

    note right of TodoListMiddleware_after_model
        after_model: Manages list of planned tasks to be done,
        decides if execution is complete, needs tool invocation, or direct model loop
    end note

    PatchToolCallsMiddleware_before_agent --> LocalContextMiddleware_before_agent : Preprocess tool calls
    LocalContextMiddleware_before_agent --> model : Enriched system prompt
    model --> HumanInTheLoopMiddleware_after_model : Model responds with text/tool calls
    HumanInTheLoopMiddleware_after_model --> TodoListMiddleware_after_model : User approved or bypassed
    
    state todo_list_routing_gate <<choice>>
    TodoListMiddleware_after_model --> todo_list_routing_gate
    
    todo_list_routing_gate --> tools : Tools need to be called
    todo_list_routing_gate --> model : Direct model loop (no tool execution)
    todo_list_routing_gate --> [*] : Task completed / Done
    
    tools --> model : Feed tool results back to model
